      "tier": 1,
      "title": "WAIT FOR LSN 被报告存在死锁与升主竞态",
      "summary": "Xuneng Zhou 报告了 WAIT FOR LSN 实现的四个问题。最重的是死锁：standby_replay 模式下，backend 若还持有上一条语句留下的重量级锁，可能与 startup 进程形成环路，而 WaitForLSN() 用 latch 休眠而不是 ProcSleep()，死锁检测器看不见这条依赖。另外三处是 WAL buffer 回收缺唤醒、升主后重读 LSN 的竞态和恢复非显式结束时的返回语义。",
      "url": "https://www.postgresql.org/message-id/CABPTF7VVtcTQX1U4o5XpjAXZHLkEhCe3aXVHNYxGYbhxFX3d4w@mail.gmail.com",
      "author": "Xuneng Zhou",
      "source": "PostgreSQL hackers",
      "source_date": "2026-09-06",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "WAIT FOR",
        "复制",
        "死锁"
      ],
      "position": 1
    },
